                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Phelps to Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-09-12"><hi rendition="#italic">September 12,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Pork admitted on American inspection certificate. Germany imposes no other
                    condition.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phelps</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
